" from Direct Messages and will be kept in other rooms. Delete All Messages: Al"
"l messages and files from the user will be deleted from the database and it wi"
"ll not be possible to locate the user anymore. Remove link between user and me"
"ssages: This option will assign all messages and files of the user to Rocket.C"
"hat bot and Direct Messages are going to be deleted."
